From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Capture bracketed MT6357 live battery measurements

Pair current and charge in each fuel-gauge latch around raw voltage,
thermistor and reference ADC reads. Keep per-field errors and timing,
including independent battery presence and cleanup failures. Link the
ADC supplier lifetime and optionally report one acquisition during probe.
No capacity estimate or charging configuration is changed.

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/mt6357-gauge.c b/drivers/power/supply/mt6357-gauge.c
--- a/drivers/power/supply/mt6357-gauge.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/mt6357-gauge.c
